"content": "<h1>Mlima wa Mizeituni</h1><h2>Ufafanuzi:</h2><p>Mlima wa Mizeituni ni mlima au kilima kikubwa kilichopo karibu na upande wa mashariki wa jiji la Yerusalemu. Unakaribia mita 787 juu.</p><ul><li><p>Kwenye Agano la Kale, mlima huu wakati mwingine hujulikana kama &quot;mlima ulio mashariki mwa Yerusalemu.&quot;</p></li><li><p>Agano Jipya linarekodi matukio kadhaa ambapo Yesu na wanafunzi wake walikwenda kwenye  Mlima wa Mizeituni kuomba na kupumzika.</p></li><li><p>Yesu alikamatwa katika Bustani ya Gethsemane, ambayo iko kwenye Mlima wa Mizeituni.</p></li><li><p>Hii inaweza pia kutafsiriwa kama &quot;Kilima cha Mzeituni&quot; au &quot;Mlima wa Mti wa Mzeituni.&quot;</p></li></ul><p>(Tazama pia: Tafsiri ya Majina)</p><p>(Tazama pia: <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"25776\" data-resource-code=\"UWTranslationWords\">Gethsemane</data>, <data class=\"resource-ref\" data-content-id=\"26062\" data-resource-code=\"UWTranslationWords\">mzeituni</data>)</p><h2>Marejeleo ya Biblia:</h2><ul><li><p><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"42019029\" data-end-ref=\"42019029\">Luka 19:29</data></p></li><li><p><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"42019037\" data-end-ref=\"42019037\">Luka 19:37</data></p></li><li><p><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"41013003\" data-end-ref=\"41013003\">Marko 13:3</data></p></li><li><p><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40021001\" data-end-ref=\"40021003\">Mathayo 21:1–3</data></p></li><li><p><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40024003\" data-end-ref=\"40024005\">Mathayo 24:3–5</data></p></li><li><p><data class=\"bible-ref\" data-start-ref=\"40026030\" data-end-ref=\"40026030\">Mathayo 26:30</data></p></li></ul><h2>Data ya Neno:</h2><ul><li><p>Strong&apos;s: H2022, H2132, G37350, G16360</p></li></ul>",
